        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Concepts: House dance, Jacking\n- Organizations: House Dance International\n- Places: New York City\n- Topics: Street dance festival, House music, Electronic dance music\n\nFacts:\n- House dance includes the main elements Footwork, Jacking, and Lofting.\n- Jacking, or the jack, is a freestyle dance move in which a dancer ripples the torso back and forth in an undulating motion.\n- House Dance International is an annual street dance festival based in New York City.\n- House Dance International highlights House dance, Vogue, Hustle, Waacking, and Experimental.\n- House Dance International features art forms performed to house music or derivatives of electronic dance music.",
